cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Sequential products on Euclidean Jordan algebras: a Lean 4 formalization"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proofs that the sequential-product axioms S1-S7 of van de Wetering force the
  Lueders product on the Hermitian real matrices and the twist normal form, with a unique
  parameter, on the Hermitian complex matrices of size at least three. Also includes
  Albert's power-associativity theorem for commutative Jordan rings and the
  finite-dimensional real, non-bijective Wigner theorem.
authors:
  - family-names: Ehrlich
    given-names: Bryan
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehrlich-b/sequential-products-lean"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalized mathematics
  - Jordan algebras
  - sequential product
  - operator algebras
  - quantum foundations
